 "notes": [
  "Following the concept elevation, the 15x18 ft car porch sits on the right with a front lawn on the left, while the upper storey pairs a front bedroom behind a decorative jali feature on the left with the master balcony on the right.",
  "The parents' bedroom on the ground floor opens directly off the TV lounge and enjoys a dedicated dressing alcove, an attached 6x9 ft bathroom, and a rear garden window.",
  "An open kitchen connects directly to the central TV lounge, while a separate dirty kitchen beside it vents and opens to the 7 ft rear service space.",
  "All four bedrooms have independent access and attached bathrooms, with Bath 3 stacked directly over the ground floor Parents' Bath and the roof mumty opening onto the front roof slab above Bedroom 2."
 ],
